OL,3,C'Creative world' for FE college
OL,4,Cstudents as numbers increase by near
OL,5,C20%
OL,7,FBy Nathan Hylands
OL,9,FThere has been almost a 20% increase
OL,10,Fin the number of students going to
OL,11,FFurther Education (FE) colleges in
OL,12,FNorthern Ireland (NI) over the last
OL,13,Ffive years.
OL,15,FThat is according to the latest
OL,16,Ffigures from the Department for the
OL,17,FEconomy and Northern Ireland
OL,18,FStatistics and Research Agency (NISRA).
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
