PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786812486
OL,3,C'Creative world' for FE college
OL,4,Cstudents as numbers increase by near
OL,5,C20%
OL,7,FOne college said it highlights how
OL,8,Fsociety recognises the "career-
OL,9,Forientated" pathway for students.
OL,11,FThere are six FE colleges in Northern
OL,12,FIreland that operate across 29
OL,13,Fcampuses to provide academic,
OL,14,Fprofessional and technical education
OL,15,Fand training.
OL,17,FAoife Harvey from Claudy was sketching
OL,18,Fout an artistic career for herself
OL,19,Ffrom a young age.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
