PN,41203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786812486
OL,3,C'Creative world' for FE college
OL,4,Cstudents as numbers increase by near
OL,5,C20%
OL,7,F"I loved drawing. I loved making
OL,8,Fanything out of cardboard boxes. I
OL,9,Falways knew I was a creative person.
OL,11,F"I done my GCSEs and loads of
OL,12,Fsubjects, but I always knew that the
OL,13,Fart route was where I wanted to
OL,14,Fultimately end up."
OL,16,FAfter her results, she decided the
OL,17,FNorth West Regional College would help
OL,18,Fweave her way towards university.
OL,20,FShe studied a Level 3 Art and Design
OL,21,Fcourse.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
