FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786812486
OL,3,C'Creative world' for FE college
OL,4,Cstudents as numbers increase by near
OL,5,C20%
OL,7,F"My granny would have had aunts who
OL,8,Fworked in the shirt factory in Derry,
OL,9,Fso there was definitely a textile
OL,10,Fhistory that I wanted to explore
OL,11,Ffurther," she said.
OL,13,F"It was amazing. It was just on my
OL,14,Fdoorstep and every day I could just go
OL,15,Finto this creative world."
OL,17,FAoife is just one of many who chose to
OL,18,Fgo down the FE pathway.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/10
