OL,3,C'Creative world' for FE college
OL,4,Cstudents as numbers increase by near
OL,5,C20%
OL,7,FThe number of students in the sector
OL,8,Frose by a net 19% between 2020/21 and
OL,9,F2024/25.
OL,11,FThat represents an increase from
OL,12,F55,970 students to 66,690.
OL,14,FThe figure includes a 5% increase in
OL,15,Fthe most recent academic year recorded
OL,16,Fin 2024/25.
OL,18,FCaleb Turley from Crumlin was always
OL,19,Frunning towards becoming a personal
OL,20,Ftrainer.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
