PN,41206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786812486
OL,3,C'Creative world' for FE college
OL,4,Cstudents as numbers increase by near
OL,5,C20%
OL,7,FHis pathway at the South Eastern
OL,8,FRegional College provided him direct
OL,9,Fentry into his job.
OL,11,FThe 18-year-old recently completed a
OL,12,FLevel 3 National Diploma in Sport,
OL,13,FFitness and Personal Training.
OL,15,F"We could do on-site learning, where
OL,16,Fwe would be in the gym.
OL,18,F"It was half a day at the start, but
OL,19,Fthen it increased to two days near the
OL,20,Fend of the year," he said.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
