PN,41207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786812486
OL,3,C'Creative world' for FE college
OL,4,Cstudents as numbers increase by near
OL,5,C20%
OL,7,F"I think the college was way better
OL,8,Fthan going on to doing a course that
OL,9,Fcould have lasted me four years
OL,10,Fbecause I'm doing a job now.
OL,12,F"I can get settled down, and it's
OL,13,Falmost a head start."
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
