OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786812486
OL,3,C'Creative world' for FE college
OL,4,Cstudents as numbers increase by near
OL,5,C20%
OL,7,FDeputy Principal of Curriculum at the
OL,8,FSouth Eastern Regional College, Gary
OL,9,FRitchie said: "I do believe that there
OL,10,Fis that element of a real recognition
OL,11,Fwithin society that vocational
OL,12,Fpathways are equitable and deliver
OL,13,Fsimilar outcomes to that traditional
OL,14,Facademic pathway.
OL,16,F"There's an element that's related to
OL,17,Fthat career-orientated education where
OL,18,Findividuals know where they want to be
OL,19,Fand know what they want to do."
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G8/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
