OL,3,C'Creative world' for FE college
OL,4,Cstudents as numbers increase by near
OL,5,C20%
OL,7,FThe FE route has proved a success for
OL,8,Fthe young people and has given them
OL,9,Fdrive for the future.
OL,11,FAoife said: "I went to Paris Fashion
OL,12,FWeek and done their Sustainable
OL,13,FFashion Week, and also showcased at
OL,14,FManchester Fashion Week, so many doors
OL,15,Fwere opened."
OL,17,FCaleb said: "I have thought about
OL,18,Fdoing a sports massage course and then
OL,19,Fmaybe in a few years time, I'll go on
OL,20,Fand open my own gym or open my own
OL,21,Fbusiness as a personal trainer."
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G9/10
